#MANUAL
ie.manual.entry.multiblockDisassembly.name=Multiblock Disassembly
ie.manual.entry.multiblockDisassembly.subtext=Take it apart, keep the parts
ie.manual.entry.multiblockDisassembly0=Breaking any block of a formed machine dismantles the whole structure. It comes apart block by block over a few moments, and all of its construction materials drop at the block that was broken. Sneak while breaking to revert to the classic behavior instead, where the structure instantly turns back into its placed blocks. Setting disassemblyMode to TEMPLATE_BLOCKS in the config makes the classic behavior the default.
ie.manual.entry.clearingTanks.name=Clearing Tanks
ie.manual.entry.clearingTanks.subtext=Out with the wrong fluid
ie.manual.entry.clearingTanks0=Fluid input ports accept any fluid piped into them, and a machine holding the wrong fluid will sit idle until that tank is emptied. Sneak and use the Engineer's Hammer on a fluid input port to empty it.<br>The fluid is discarded rather than returned, so the tank is free for the correct fluid immediately. This works on Immersive Engineering, Immersive Petroleum and Immersive Technology machines with a fluid input; output and storage tanks are never touched.
